id=MTK_D8100_Vulkan1.4.Panvk
name=Dimensity 8100 PanVK WSI7 (Vulkan only)
version=1.1.0
versionCode=12
author=wxcvm; upstream zenithblue-oss
description=PanVK WSI7 FINAL 1.1.0 (Mesa 26.3 + patches 019-038) for PGKM10/Android 17. Project conclusion: the driver fixes work (GPU-uncached imports for the SystemUI shareability fault, one-shot Android acquire replay for WeChat, AFBC YU10 Vulkan import, and SurfaceFlinger skiavkthreaded validated with Vulkan device initialized). HWUI Vulkan stays disabled because ColorOS/Skia aborts on vendor 10-bit AHB (format 4096). Final release; keep the OEM render path unless you explicitly want to experiment. See docs/FINAL-REPORT.md for results, limitations and rollback.
